## Which license covers what

| Part of the repo                                                                                                    | License                 |
| ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- | ----------------------- |
| `src/components/`, `src/render/`, `src/hooks/`, `src/lib/`, `src/utils/`, `src/constants/`, `src/debug/`, `src/test/` | MIT                     |
| `src/audio/` — audio playback engine (`AudioManager.js`, `useAudio.js`)                                             | MIT                     |
| `src/App.jsx`, `src/main.jsx`, `src/index.css`, `src/styles/`                                                       | MIT                     |
| `scripts/`, `.githooks/` — build tooling and quality guards                                                         | MIT                     |
| `vite.config.js`, `eslint.config.js`, `svgo.config.js`, `jsconfig.json`, `components.json`, `.github/workflows/`    | MIT                     |
| `src/lo-config/` — Learning Object manifests, blocks, exercises, modals                                             | CC BY-NC 4.0            |
| `src/index-fr.json` — Learning Object menu index                                                                    | CC BY-NC 4.0            |
| `public/audio/` — authored learning audio                                                                           | CC BY-NC 4.0            |
| `public/img/` — authored learning imagery (except the marks listed below)                                           | CC BY-NC 4.0            |
| `src/assets/lo9/` — authored learning graphics                                                                      | CC BY-NC 4.0            |
| `docs/`, `CHANGES.md`, `AGENTS.md`, `README.md` — specs, handovers, process notes                                   | CC BY-NC 4.0            |
| `public/img/common/footer/lc-logo-*.svg`, `cc-logo-*.svg`, `elearning-logo-*.svg`                                   | **neither** — see below |
| Cambridge logos, wordmarks and visual-language imagery wherever they appear                                         | **neither** — see below |
| `public/fonts/Feijoa-*.woff2`, `src/assets/fonts-src/Feijoa-*.otf`                                                  | **neither** — see below |

Third-party dependencies are covered by their own licenses. Open Sans, the
public default typeface, is Apache-2.0 — this covers both
`public/fonts/OpenSans-*.woff2` and `src/assets/fonts-src/OpenSans-*.ttf`.

